_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/ef86a9b4e0b40d8d20de9d7668c9785d.poster.avif?t=1750433508\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/ef86a9b4e0b40d8d20de9d7668c9785d.webm?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/ef86a9b4e0b40d8d20de9d7668c9785d.mp4?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/49445850eccedba1f5f6b8a0e20cb099.webp?t=1750433508\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Meaningful Relationships</strong> \u2013 Forge friendships with the townsfolk, gain unique benefits, and even find romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/9fab114f6832b4908fad3e66b02dcff1.poster.avif?t=1750433508\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/9fab114f6832b4908fad3e66b02dcff1.webm?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/9fab114f6832b4908fad3e66b02dcff1.mp4?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/82fbfc33e904630dbb7b9dc9a13a2181.webp?t=1750433508\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0<strong>4-Player Co-op Mode</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends to farm, explore, and battle together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/edfb253b4de0f8f49b43b92b5038a810.poster.avif?t=1750433508\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/edfb253b4de0f8f49b43b92b5038a810.webm?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/edfb253b4de0f8f49b43b92b5038a810.mp4?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/c325a73ed213deb47c9d80c40cc4443e.webp?t=1750433508\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Quests &amp; Lore</strong> \u2013 Unravel the town\u2019s secrets, take part in a gripping storyline, and help defend the sacred Tree of Life from the corrupted lumberjacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/dc645cb4b4c935e3c40a836e1dacd63b.poster.avif?t=1750433508\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/dc645cb4b4c935e3c40a836e1dacd63b.webm?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/dc645cb4b4c935e3c40a836e1dacd63b.mp4?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/3a41a9a809836023f91ed530fc0b681e.webp?t=1750433508\" width=20 height=20 /></span>\u00a0<strong>Farm &amp; Home Customization</strong> \u2013 Decorate and upgrade your farm, build workstations, place fences, and furnish your home to your liking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/b30407849a14b7cfdb0b47d0d891293f.poster.avif?t=1750433508\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/b30407849a14b7cfdb0b47d0d891293f.webm?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/b30407849a14b7cfdb0b47d0d891293f.mp4?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/7bd32c0b5e26a4cd0dcd52ffa17802ee.webp?t=1750433508\" width=20 height=20 /></span><strong>\u00a0Fishing Adventures</strong> \u2013 Cast your line and discover hidden treasures beneath the waters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/c827727767461603c91f59f4d9f2a80d.poster.avif?t=1750433508\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/c827727767461603c91f59f4d9f2a80d.webm?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/c827727767461603c91f59f4d9f2a80d.mp4?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/88f189649f02564d4e05eeb31d534a7e.webp?t=1750433508\" width=20 height=20 /></span><strong>\u00a0Mystical Alcomy</strong> \u2013 Brew magical alcomic concoctions with unique effects\u2014some requiring ancient rituals to perfect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/471aefd760e27661756aedc014f837cf.poster.avif?t=1750433508\" width=616 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/471aefd760e27661756aedc014f837cf.webm?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/471aefd760e27661756aedc014f837cf.mp4?t=1750433508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533500/extras/a883b6e8ad80e79e99c0480087431950.avif?t=1750433508\" width=594 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaforia</strong>, a mysterious town where fate has taken an unexpected turn for you. Caught red-handed for illegally copying and selling books, you now find yourself <strong>paying off a hefty fine</strong> by managing the rundown <strong>farm of old Walter</strong>. As you till the soil and tend to your crops, you uncover a deeper conflict\u2014the townsfolk, devoted protectors of nature, are in a desperate struggle against a band of cursed lumberjacks determined to fell the legendary <strong>Tree of Life</strong>.</p>",
